OL,3,GNEWSAMP raises concern over 'reservoirs
OL,4,Arunning dry'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn MP has voiced concerns over the
OL,7,Ffalling levels of reservoirs in Devon,
OL,8,FCornwall and Somerset - warning it
OL,9,Fhighlights the challenges facing
OL,10,Fsupplies in a changing climate.
OL,12,FWimbleball on Exmoor has dropped to
OL,13,F14.9% capacity, with Rachel Gilmore, MP
OL,14,Ffor Tiverton and Minehead, saying: "If
OL,15,Fyou've got reservoirs that are running
OL,16,Fdry, there is obviously a problem."
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,346,340,200,160,0,100
