OL,3,GNEWSAMP raises concern over 'reservoirs
OL,4,Arunning dry'
OL,5,
OL,6,FSouth West Water (SWW) introduced a
OL,7,Fhosepipe ban in August and is also
OL,8,Fconsidering further restrictions that
OL,9,Fcould impact businesses like car washes
OL,10,Fand window cleaners in the area
OL,11,Fsupplied by the reservoir.
OL,13,FThe company said that reservoirs levels
OL,14,Fhave been "significantly impacted" by
OL,15,Fhigher demand after the hottest summer
OL,16,Fon record.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
